# The CC0 Sony a7 IV (ILCE-7M4) sample raws the real-RAW regression suite reads, one per
# compression mode, from raw.pixls.us. scripts/fetch-samples.sh fetches and verifies them
# into ./samples.
#
# Columns: SHA-256, size in bytes, file name in samples/, source URL.
# Provenance (docs/ci-regression.md): each hash and size is the one in raw.pixls.us's own
# git-LFS mirror (https://raw.pixls.us/data.lfs.git, pointer files Sony/ILCE-7M4/<name>,
# dump of 2026-10-09, commit be3dc02d) and matches the bytes fetched on 2026-10-05.
# Never edit a hash by hand to make a check pass.
